{"seq":2,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理：Session Token、心跳与超时迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/architecture/session-management","wordCount":1276,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"会话管理-session-token-心跳与超时迁移\">会话管理：Session Token、心跳与超时迁移</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Lobby Session</strong></td>\n<td>玩家进入大厅后服务端维护的有状态记录，标识&quot;该玩家当前在哪个房间&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>应用层心跳</strong></td>\n<td>在 WebSocket 协议层之上的 Ping/Pong，检测 NAT 静默关闭的连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>宽限期（Grace Period）</strong></td>\n<td>心跳超时后不立即清理会话，而是等待玩家重连的缓冲时间窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>会话迁移</strong></td>\n<td>服务器重启或扩缩容时，将玩家会话无感知地转移到新节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Migration Token</strong></td>\n<td>一次性短期凭证，用于会话迁移时的安全身份传递</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"什么是大厅会话\">什么是大厅会话？</h2><p>大厅会话（Lobby Session）是玩家进入大厅后服务端维护的一条有状态记录，标识&quot;这个玩家当前在线，正处于某个房间&quot;。会话管理需要解决四个问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>身份绑定</strong>：如何将一条 WebSocket 连接与特定玩家身份绑定？</li>\n<li><strong>存活检测</strong>：如何知道玩家是否还在线（网络断了但没有发 Close 帧）？</li>\n<li><strong>超时清理</strong>：玩家长时间不响应时，如何清理其大厅状态而不误删活跃连接？</li>\n<li><strong>会话迁移</strong>：服务器重启或扩缩容时，如何将玩家会话无感知地迁移到新实例？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"session-token-设计\">Session Token 设计</h2><h3 id=\"token-结构\">Token 结构</h3><p>大厅 Session Token 不同于游戏内 Auth Token（通常是 JWT）。大厅 Token 需要额外携带大厅上下文信息，建议采用<strong>不透明 Token + 服务端存储</strong>而非 JWT（大厅状态变化频繁，JWT 的无状态特性反而是负担）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type LobbySession struct {&#10;    SessionID  string    // UUID v4，不透明给客户端&#10;    PlayerID   string    // 关联的玩家 ID&#10;    RoomID     string    // 当前所在房间（可为空）&#10;    ServerID   string    // 持有本会话的 Lobby Server 实例 ID&#10;    CreatedAt  time.Time&#10;    LastHeartbeat time.Time&#10;    TTL        time.Duration // 默认 30 秒&#10;    Metadata   map[string]string // 平台、版本、地区等&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LobbySession</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SessionID  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // UUID v4，不透明给客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PlayerID   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 关联的玩家 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RoomID     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 当前所在房间（可为空）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ServerID   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 持有本会话的 Lobby Server 实例 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CreatedAt  </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LastHeartbeat </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TTL        </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 默认 30 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Metadata   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 平台、版本、地区等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Token 本身是随机生成的不透明字符串（UUID v4 或 32 字节随机值 Base62 编码），存储在 Redis 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"lobby:session:{session_id} → JSON(LobbySession)&#10;TTL = session.TTL + buffer  (Redis TTL 略大于业务 TTL，避免 Race)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>lobby:session:{session_id} → JSON(LobbySession)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>TTL = session.TTL + buffer  (Redis TTL 略大于业务 TTL，避免 Race)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"token-生命周期\">Token 生命周期</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"玩家认证成功&#10;    ↓&#10;POST /lobby/sessions&#10;    ↓&#10;生成 SessionID + 写入 Redis&#10;    ↓&#10;返回 SessionID 给客户端&#10;    ↓&#10;客户端用 SessionID 建立 WebSocket 连接&#10;    (WebSocket URL: wss://lobby.example.com/ws?session=&lt;SessionID&gt;)&#10;    ↓&#10;服务端验证 SessionID 有效性 → 绑定 ws.conn 与 LobbySession&#10;    ↓&#10;维持连接 → 定期心跳 → 更新 LastHeartbeat&#10;    ↓&#10;断开连接 or 主动退出 → 清理会话\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>玩家认证成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>POST /lobby/sessions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>生成 SessionID + 写入 Redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>返回 SessionID 给客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>客户端用 SessionID 建立 WebSocket 连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (WebSocket URL: wss://lobby.example.com/ws?session=&#x3C;SessionID>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>服务端验证 SessionID 有效性 → 绑定 ws.conn 与 LobbySession</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>维持连接 → 定期心跳 → 更新 LastHeartbeat</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>断开连接 or 主动退出 → 清理会话</span></span></code></pre></div><p>客户端在 WebSocket 握手阶段通过 Query String 或自定义 Header 传递 SessionID，服务端在升级到 WebSocket 前验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"心跳机制\">心跳机制</h2><h3 id=\"为什么需要应用层心跳\">为什么需要应用层心跳？</h3><p>WebSocket 协议自带 Ping/Pong 帧（RFC 6455），但依赖传输层 TCP Keepalive 不可靠：中间的 NAT 设备可能在 30~60 秒后悄悄关闭连接，而应用层感知不到。此外，如果只依赖 TCP Keepalive，服务端无法区分&quot;客户端还活着但网络短暂抖动&quot;与&quot;客户端已经崩溃&quot;。</p>\n<p>因此，大厅服务需要<strong>应用层 Ping/Pong</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"心跳设计\">心跳设计</h3><p><strong>双向心跳</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务端每 15 秒向客户端发送 <code>{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;ping&quot;, &quot;ts&quot;: 1720000000000}</code></li>\n<li>客户端收到 ping 后立即回复 <code>{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;pong&quot;, &quot;ts&quot;: 1720000000000}</code></li>\n<li>服务端记录 RTT，更新 <code>LastHeartbeat</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>单向心跳（客户端主动）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>客户端每 10 秒发送 <code>{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;heartbeat&quot;}</code></li>\n<li>服务端更新 <code>LastHeartbeat</code> 并回复 ACK</li>\n<li>适合移动端场景（省电，客户端控制频率）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"const (&#10;    HeartbeatInterval = 15 * time.Second&#10;    HeartbeatTimeout  = 45 * time.Second // 3 个心跳周期无响应 → 超时&#10;)&#10;&#10;func (s *LobbyServer) startHeartbeat(conn *WSConn, session *LobbySession) {&#10;    ticker := time.NewTicker(HeartbeatInterval)&#10;    defer ticker.Stop()&#10;&#10;    for range ticker.C {&#10;        deadline := time.Now().Add(HeartbeatTimeout)&#10;        conn.SetWriteDeadline(deadline)&#10;&#10;        if err := conn.WriteJSON(PingMessage{Type: &quot;ping&quot;, TS: time.Now().UnixMilli()}); err != nil {&#10;            s.handleDisconnect(conn, session)&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 等待 pong（通过 Read 循环接收，超时由 SetReadDeadline 控制）&#10;        conn.SetReadDeadline(time.Now().Add(HeartbeatTimeout))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    HeartbeatInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 15</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    HeartbeatTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 45</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3 个心跳周期无响应 → 超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startHeartbeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">conn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WSConn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">session</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbySession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ticker </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewTicker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(HeartbeatInterval)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ticker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ticker.C {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        deadline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(HeartbeatTimeout)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetWriteDeadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deadline)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteJSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PingMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, TS: time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UnixMilli</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()}); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleDisconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn, session)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 等待 pong（通过 Read 循环接收，超时由 SetReadDeadline 控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetReadDeadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(HeartbeatTimeout))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"心跳超时的处理策略\">心跳超时的处理策略</h3><p>超时不应立即清理会话，而应进入<strong>宽限期（Grace Period）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"心跳超时&#10;    ↓&#10;标记会话状态：DISCONNECTED（而非直接删除）&#10;    ↓&#10;等待宽限期（30~60 秒）&#10;    ↓&#10;宽限期内重连成功？&#10;    → 是：恢复 ACTIVE，继续大厅流程&#10;    → 否：清理会话，从房间移除玩家，通知其他玩家\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>心跳超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>标记会话状态：DISCONNECTED（而非直接删除）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>等待宽限期（30~60 秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>宽限期内重连成功？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 是：恢复 ACTIVE，继续大厅流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 否：清理会话，从房间移除玩家，通知其他玩家</span></span></code></pre></div><p>宽限期是断线重连的关键设计，详见第 4 章&quot;断线重连&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时策略\">超时策略</h2><p>大厅场景有多种超时需要分别管理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超时类型</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>处理动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WebSocket 读超时</td>\n<td>45s</td>\n<td>超过心跳间隔无数据</td>\n<td>关闭连接，进入断线流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话宽限期</td>\n<td>60s</td>\n<td>连接断开后</td>\n<td>等待重连，超时则清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>房间等待超时</td>\n<td>5min</td>\n<td>房间创建后未开始</td>\n<td>解散房间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准备超时</td>\n<td>60s</td>\n<td>倒计时阶段有人未准备</td>\n<td>踢出未准备玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AFK 检测</td>\n<td>2min</td>\n<td>会话活跃但无操作</td>\n<td>警告后踢出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"超时的实现方式\">超时的实现方式</h3><p><strong>Option 1：Redis TTL + Expiry 监听</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"写入 Redis Key 时设置 TTL&#10;Redis Keyspace Notification（CONFIG SET notify-keyspace-events Ex）&#10;监听 __keyevent@0__:expired 事件 → 触发超时处理逻辑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>写入 Redis Key 时设置 TTL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Redis Keyspace Notification（CONFIG SET notify-keyspace-events Ex）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>监听 __keyevent@0__:expired 事件 → 触发超时处理逻辑</span></span></code></pre></div><p>缺点：Redis Keyspace Notification 不保证 100% 送达，不适合关键业务逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>Option 2：Goroutine Timer（推荐用于 Actor 模型）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (r *RoomActor) scheduleTimeout(duration time.Duration, action TimeoutAction) {&#10;    if r.timeoutTimer != nil {&#10;        r.timeoutTimer.Stop()&#10;    }&#10;    r.timeoutTimer = time.AfterFunc(duration, func() {&#10;        r.inbox &lt;- Message{Type: MsgTimeout, Payload: action}&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">scheduleTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TimeoutAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.timeoutTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.timeoutTimer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.timeoutTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AfterFunc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(duration, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.inbox </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Type: MsgTimeout, Payload: action}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每次有相关操作时重置 Timer，超时时通过 Actor 的 inbox 触发处理，保证单线程执行。</p>\n<p><strong>Option 3：延迟队列（用于分布式场景）</strong></p>\n<p>使用 Redis Sorted Set 实现延迟队列：Key 为 session_id，Score 为期望超时的 Unix 时间戳。后台协程定期扫描到期的 Key。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 设置超时&#10;redis.ZAdd(&quot;lobby:timeouts&quot;, redis.Z{&#10;    Score:  float64(time.Now().Add(timeout).Unix()),&#10;    Member: sessionID,&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 检查到期（每秒扫一次）&#10;func (s *TimeoutScheduler) tick() {&#10;    now := float64(time.Now().Unix())&#10;    expired, _ := redis.ZRangeByScore(&quot;lobby:timeouts&quot;, redis.ZRangeBy{&#10;        Min: &quot;0&quot;, Max: strconv.FormatFloat(now, &#39;f&#39;, 0, 64),&#10;    })&#10;    for _, sessionID := range expired {&#10;        go s.handleExpired(sessionID)&#10;        redis.ZRem(&quot;lobby:timeouts&quot;, sessionID)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ZAdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lobby:timeouts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Z</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Score:  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(timeout).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Member: sessionID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检查到期（每秒扫一次）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TimeoutScheduler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    expired, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ZRangeByScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lobby:timeouts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ZRangeBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Min: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Max: strconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FormatFloat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, sessionID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expired {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleExpired</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sessionID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        redis.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ZRem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lobby:timeouts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sessionID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"会话迁移\">会话迁移</h2><p>会话迁移（Session Migration）解决服务器滚动更新时的无感切换问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发场景\">触发场景</h3><ul>\n<li>Kubernetes Rolling Update：旧 Pod 收到 SIGTERM，需要在 30 秒内完成优雅退出</li>\n<li>节点故障：某台 Lobby Server 宕机，其上的所有会话需要迁移</li>\n<li>主动扩缩容：将低负载节点上的会话迁移以便节点下线</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"迁移协议\">迁移协议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"步骤 1：迁移准备&#10;旧服务器 → 停止接受新房间请求（从服务发现下线）&#10;旧服务器 → 向现有连接广播：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;migration_incoming&quot;, &quot;new_server&quot;: &quot;lobby-2.example.com&quot;}&#10;&#10;步骤 2：状态持久化&#10;旧服务器 → 将所有 Room Actor 状态序列化 → 写入 Redis（带版本号）&#10;格式：lobby:room:{room_id}:snapshot → {state, players, version, timestamp}&#10;&#10;步骤 3：客户端重连&#10;客户端收到 migration_incoming 后，主动断开并带原 SessionID 重连到新服务器&#10;（或等旧连接断开后，客户端自动重连到 LB，LB 路由到任意可用服务器）&#10;&#10;步骤 4：状态恢复&#10;新服务器验证 SessionID → 从 Redis 加载 Room Snapshot → 重建 Room Actor&#10;玩家感知为短暂掉线（&lt; 500ms）后自动恢复到之前的大厅状态\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 1：迁移准备</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>旧服务器 → 停止接受新房间请求（从服务发现下线）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>旧服务器 → 向现有连接广播：{\"type\": \"migration_incoming\", \"new_server\": \"lobby-2.example.com\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 2：状态持久化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>旧服务器 → 将所有 Room Actor 状态序列化 → 写入 Redis（带版本号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>格式：lobby:room:{room_id}:snapshot → {state, players, version, timestamp}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 3：客户端重连</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>客户端收到 migration_incoming 后，主动断开并带原 SessionID 重连到新服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>（或等旧连接断开后，客户端自动重连到 LB，LB 路由到任意可用服务器）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 4：状态恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>新服务器验证 SessionID → 从 Redis 加载 Room Snapshot → 重建 Room Actor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>玩家感知为短暂掉线（&#x3C; 500ms）后自动恢复到之前的大厅状态</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"session-迁移-token-migration-token\">Session 迁移 Token（Migration Token）</h3><p>为避免安全问题（旧 SessionID 泄露后被恶意使用），迁移时可生成一次性 Migration Token：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type MigrationToken struct {&#10;    OldSessionID  string&#10;    NewToken      string    // 一次性，有效期 30 秒&#10;    RoomID        string&#10;    Snapshot      []byte    // 加密的房间状态快照&#10;    ExpiresAt     time.Time&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationToken</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    OldSessionID  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    NewToken      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 一次性，有效期 30 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RoomID        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Snapshot      []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 加密的房间状态快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ExpiresAt     </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>客户端用 MigrationToken 完成重连，新服务器验证 Token 后解密恢复状态，Token 立即失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话生命周期时序图\">会话生命周期时序图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant LS as Lobby Server&#10;    participant R as Redis&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;LS: POST /lobby/sessions (认证后)&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;R: SETEX session:{id} 30s LobbySession&#10;    LS--&gt;&gt;C: {session_id}&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;LS: WebSocket 握手 ?session={id}&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;R: GET session:{id} (验证)&#10;    LS--&gt;&gt;C: 连接建立&#10;&#10;    loop 每 15 秒&#10;        LS-&gt;&gt;C: ping {ts}&#10;        C-&gt;&gt;LS: pong {ts}&#10;        LS-&gt;&gt;R: 更新 LastHeartbeat&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Note over C,LS: 心跳超时 45s&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: 标记 DISCONNECTED,启动宽限期 60s&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;LS: 重连(携带 session_id)&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;R: 恢复 ACTIVE&#10;    LS--&gt;&gt;C: 房间状态快照\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant LS as Lobby Server\n    participant R as Redis\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;LS: POST /lobby/sessions (认证后)\n    LS-&gt;&gt;R: SETEX session:{id} 30s LobbySession\n    LS--&gt;&gt;C: {session_id}\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;LS: WebSocket 握手 ?session={id}\n    LS-&gt;&gt;R: GET session:{id} (验证)\n    LS--&gt;&gt;C: 连接建立\n\n    loop 每 15 秒\n        LS-&gt;&gt;C: ping {ts}\n        C-&gt;&gt;LS: pong {ts}\n        LS-&gt;&gt;R: 更新 LastHeartbeat\n    end\n\n    Note over C,LS: 心跳超时 45s\n    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: 标记 DISCONNECTED,启动宽限期 60s\n    C-&gt;&gt;LS: 重连(携带 session_id)\n    LS-&gt;&gt;R: 恢复 ACTIVE\n    LS--&gt;&gt;C: 房间状态快照</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>大厅会话管理的核心是三层机制的协作：不透明 Session Token 绑定身份（存储于 Redis，不使用 JWT 以支持频繁更新）；应用层 Ping/Pong 覆盖 TCP Keepalive 的盲区（NAT 静默断开）；宽限期机制将&quot;断线&quot;与&quot;离开&quot;解耦，为断线重连预留时间窗口。会话迁移则通过一次性 Migration Token 在滚动更新时实现无感切换，玩家感知的掉线时间控制在 500ms 以内。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"会话管理：Session Token、心跳与超时迁移","id":"会话管理-session-token-心跳与超时迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是大厅会话？","id":"什么是大厅会话"},{"level":2,"text":"Session Token 设计","id":"session-token-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"Token 结构","id":"token-结构"},{"level":3,"text":"Token 生命周期","id":"token-生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"心跳机制","id":"心跳机制"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要应用层心跳？","id":"为什么需要应用层心跳"},{"level":3,"text":"心跳设计","id":"心跳设计"},{"level":3,"text":"心跳超时的处理策略","id":"心跳超时的处理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"超时策略","id":"超时策略"},{"level":3,"text":"超时的实现方式","id":"超时的实现方式"},{"level":2,"text":"会话迁移","id":"会话迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"触发场景","id":"触发场景"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移协议","id":"迁移协议"},{"level":3,"text":"Session 迁移 Token（Migration Token）","id":"session-迁移-token-migration-token"},{"level":2,"text":"会话生命周期时序图","id":"会话生命周期时序图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大厅服务设计：有状态架构、Actor 模型与 Agones 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/architecture/lobby-service-design"},"next":{"title":"房间生命周期：FSM 状态机、玩家容量与属性管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/architecture/room-lifecycle"}}